  ('zcrm_5797994000003196518', 'MantaBio', 'MantaBio', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Jack Regan', 'Developer of a real-time polymerase chain reaction (PCR) platform designed for automated microbial contamination detection for biopharma applications. The company''s platform provides fully automated, rapid molecular testing at the point-of-need to detect most pathogens, biological contaminants and improve manufacturing efficiency and address the unmet market need for rapid microbial contamination testing, enabling manufacturers to reduce downtime, avoid batch loss and respond quickly when every hour matters.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-09-07 15:55:34', '2026-01-28 11:51:03', '2026-01-28 11:51:03'),
