  ('zcrm_5797994000003199094', 'Basis', 'Basis', 'Devon Devanney', 'Matt Harpe', 'Basis is an AI-driven company that specializes in accounting automation through advanced AI agents. The company develops AI agents that assist accountants by managing workflows and integrating seamlessly with existing systems like ledgers and file management tools. Basis positions itself as a colleague to accountants, enhancing their capabilities without competing with accounting firms.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Devon Devanney', 'Rejected', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2025-08-31 17:58:41', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
