  ('zcrm_5797994000003224148', 'Slang', 'Slang', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Diego Villegas', 'Slang use a proprietary ML-driven engine and offers an unprecedented variety of online specialized English courses for career development.
Slang started at MIT as a research project on how to use AI and NLP to make learning a new language as efficient as possible. Their technology powers a highly adaptive e-learning platform that offersproficiency tests for career development in over a hundred fields like Sales, Finance, Logistics, Medicine, and Law. They already have the largest professional English offering in the world.
Now, Slang is scaling up to release 1,000 more courses over the next three years.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-09 13:41:00', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003224183', 'Particula', 'Particula', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Udi Dor', 'Particula is a well-funded developer of cutting edge, smart connected toys and games. We define the future of play, by reviving new life to the timeless classics and powering them into the digital era. A new generation of ("Phygital") games and toys, empowered with “brain and connectivity”, IoT technologies, and accompanied with premiumapps that bridge the physical experience with the digital space. Empowering people to attain life enriching skills in a fun and engaging way.
Our award winning products open up a whole new fun and exciting way to develop new skills, improve, play and socialize together near or far!
The company is a pioneer in its field, focusing on popular (evergreen) family favorites and STEM educational games with worldwide recognition with respect to their unique design, advanced tech and high quality values for families, parents and kids!
Our flagship product, GoCube, is an app-enabled connected Cube which allows players to learn, play and battle with friends from anywhere around the globe. We''re proud of our 5 star rating on Amazon, and loved by over 300,000 customers worldwide.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-09 13:50:27', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003224218', 'Prisms VR', 'Prisms VR', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Anarupe Ganguly', 'risms VR is a STEM education platform that utilizes virtual reality. Prisms VR uses immersive tactile environments to connect 3D, 2D, and 1D representations of core Algebra and Geometry concepts for deep understanding, retention, and long-term standards-aligned proficiency. Prisms VR engages students by immersing them in real-world situations thatare interesting and captivating, which naturally brings out arithmetic intuition, sense-making, and goal-driven problem-solving.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-09 13:54:04', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003224254', 'Numerade', 'Numerade', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Alex Lee', 'Numerade are singularly focused on creating exceptional video and interactive content experiences for education making the knowledge and skills of world class educators widely accessible and affordable to student audiences of all backgrounds. Numerade mission is to close the educational opportunity gap by unlocking and democratizing access toextraordinary educators and the content they have to offer.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-09 14:36:30', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003224289', 'Cerca Dating', 'Cerca Dating', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Thatcher Shultz', 'Meet Cerca, the brand-new dating app that offers a safe, anonymous environment for building meaningful relationships with mutual connections.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', 'Instagram', 'Reached Out', 'Khalil Thomas', 'On Hold', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-09 14:54:40', '2025-10-01 06:10:40', '2025-10-01 06:10:40'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003224341', 'Boulo Solutions', 'Boulo Solutions', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Delphine Carter', 'The lack of career progression, professional support, and flexibility in mothers'' jobs makes staying in the workforce difficult. Once mothers leave, they struggle to get back in. Boulo keeps women in the workforce by surfacing flexible jobs and offering customized, progressive professional training and support through our online platform.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-09 15:11:36', '2025-09-19 15:42:40', '2025-09-19 15:42:40'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003224376', 'CollegeContact', 'CollegeContact', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Sophie Smith', 'College Contact is a SaaS platform that connects college applicants to college undergraduates for admissions advising.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', 'EdTech Week', 'Reached Out', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-09 15:20:29', '2025-11-10 06:26:36', '2025-11-10 06:26:36'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003224411', 'Top Tier Lessons', 'Top Tier Lessons', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Cara Bogner', 'Top Tier Lessons is a 3-sided marketplace designed specifically as a way for student athletes to make money, on their own terms, doing the sport they love. Top Tier Lessons connects student athletes with parents in the local community looking for sports lessons for their kids. Our process is incredibly simple. A student athlete is able to go ontothe site, sign up and list their time availability similar to how you fill out a when2meet. Parents then browse the selection of student athletes in their area, and book a time slot and lesson through the site. The venue is either chosen by the parent or we suggest one in the area based on our partnerships. We handle the venue, payment, scheduling and safety of each lesson', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development;Sports and Wellness', 'Spring 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-09 15:27:10', '2026-01-05 14:55:36', '2026-01-05 14:55:36'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003224437', 'Sootchy', 'Sootchy', 'Khalil Thomas', 'David Adefeso', 'Sootchy is platform to help reduce the U.S household student debt. Providing a better future for our kids.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-09 15:32:02', '2025-11-09 13:01:42', '2025-11-09 13:01:42'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003224472', 'The Wealth Factory', 'The Wealth Factory', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Get Wealthy Life', 'About the Company
The Wealth Factory designs WealthyLife financial literacy education technology games, curriculum, and fintech products. Our first game, CreditStacker, teaches credit management through a free match-three game, similar to Candy Crush, by allowing users to swap pieces to pay off their debt, achieve a high credit score and learn from themultiple-choice questions.
It has been named the best financial literacy product in the country by The White House, Department of Education, and JP Morgan Chase. Washington Life named it the top financial literacy product in the world and Google confirmed, inducting it into their Top 50 Apps department. It''s also the #1 most downloaded edtech app in 14 countries on Apple, top 5 in 40 countries.
The WealthyLife financial literacy textbook has been adopted by the Department of Education Family Engagement Policies.
Our fintech product, CreditRich, enables users to round up spare change to pay off their debt in monthly installments leveraging our proprietary algorithm to unconsciously raise credit scores for $9.99 per month. We are partnered with Experian and launched on the Google Play store in April 2021.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-09 15:39:48', '2025-09-17 06:45:52', '2025-09-17 06:45:52'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003224513', 'Lectera', 'Lectera', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Mila Semeshinka', 'Lectera.com is a group of companies with offices in the USA and UAE. This structure allows the even and simultaneous development of the platform in all markets, to meet educational needs in any region of the world. An international team, which works on the project, represents 45 countries. The in-house software, also including a powerful CRM systemand own analytical center, was developed with the Fast Education teaching method. All courses are the intellectual property of Lectera.com. As of 2023, the platform has over 2 mln students and offers over 350 courses in nine areas – such as the Digital age professions, Marketing, Soft skills, Sales, Lead Generation, Female leadership. All courses – each consisting of eight to ten 15-20-minute video lessons – are available in five languages: English, German, Spanish, Russian and Hindi.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-09 15:46:51', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
