  ('zcrm_5797994000003228041', 'RealAssets', 'RealAssets', 'Kortney St. Preux', 'Suresh Nichani', 'Operator of a real estate investing platform intended to assist high-net-worth individuals, family offices, and institutional investors to invest in institutional-quality real estate. The company''s cloud-based platform revolutionizes the way investors can approach investment-grade real estate by providing them with direct access to carefully curated properties that were the domain of the large fund managers and fund of funds, and reduces financial intermediation and friction costs, enabling investors with vetted and targeted investments that can offer superior returns on a risk-adjusted basis.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', 'PitchBooks', 'Reached Out', 'Kortney St Preux', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Market Outlook', NULL, '2025-09-08 06:29:33', '2026-02-26 15:47:23', '2026-02-26 15:47:23'),
