  ('zcrm_5797994000003228234', 'ARMR Systems', 'ARMR Systems', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Chibueze Ihenacho', 'Developer of hemorrhage control systems designed to increase the survivability of traumatic injuries on the battlefield. The company''s systems comprise an ergonomically fitted, non-restrictive harness coupled with a tourniquet-style direct pressure device which provides rapid compression of damaged arteries in the critical torso-junctional areas to restrict blood loss, enabling military personnel to prevent soldiers'' death due to blood loss and hemorrhage in the absence of medical assistance.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', 'PitchBook', 'Reached Out', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Quick Screen', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-09 18:05:40', '2026-02-17 19:54:45', '2026-02-17 19:54:45'),
