controlled amounts of nitric oxide within packaging enclosures, eliminating the need for third-party sterilization facilities and reducing delays, providing healthcare providers with a customizable sterilization process that improves safety and operational efficiency.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitoria Lunardi de Castro', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-09 18:01:59', '2025-09-15 19:15:21', '2025-09-15 19:15:21'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003229291', 'Peelon', 'PeelOn', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Takar Ramji Moturu', 'Developer of a biodegradable packaging process designed to address the challenges of food waste and plastic pollution in the fresh produce supply chain. The company''s proprietary blend of natural materials creates a microclimate around the produce, tripling its shelf life and preserving freshness and quality for longer periods, reducing food waste and the need for frequent transportation and storage, leading to a smaller carbon footprint and is compostable, making it an eco-friendly alternative to traditional options, enabling businesses to avail sustainable and efficient packaging options.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitoria Lunardi', 'Source', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-09-09 18:05:57', '2025-09-15 19:05:52', '2025-09-15 19:05:52'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003229312', 'ReSource Chemical', 'ReSource Chemical', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Aanindeeta Banerjee', 'Developer of carbon dioxide-derived chemicals intended for creating plastics that do not accumulate in the environment. The company offers a proprietary bio-based platform chemical that allows for the creation of plastics that have better physical properties and performance than plastics made from fossil fuels, enabling clients to acquire sustainable plastics.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitoria Lunardi de Castro', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-09 18:12:07', '2025-09-15 18:59:38', '2025-09-15 18:59:38'),
