  ('zcrm_5797994000003229503', 'ClearCut Surgical', 'ClearCut Surgical', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Alex Yang', 'Developer of a surgical medical device designed to identify and solve problems that practicing surgeons face every day. The company offers an injection-molded plastic device that does not require additional electric power, which combines electrocautery, continuous smoke evacuation, and on-demand fluid suction, enabling doctors and surgical teams to switch functions with a pneumatic piston that connects to the vacuum suction in the wall of the operating room.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-09-10 07:02:20', '2026-01-28 11:52:01', '2026-01-28 11:52:01'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003229529', 'Cascala Health', 'Cascala Health', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Matt Murphy', 'Developer of an integrated care transitions platform designed to help healthcare providers and patients bridge communication gaps between hospital discharge and post-acute care. The company''s platform offers care navigation, medication management, proactive in-home care, transition event monitoring and patient engagement within post-acute care facilities, enabling patients to avoid hospital readmissions and promote long-term health in risk-based care models.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-09-10 07:06:18', '2026-01-28 11:52:11', '2026-01-28 11:52:11'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003229555', 'Prosperous Robotics', 'Prosperous Robotics', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Maja Rudinac', 'Developer of autonomous robotic systems designed for physical assistance and emotional support in eldercare environments. The company''s platform integrates AI-guided rehabilitation, modular mobility features, vitality tracking, caregiver communication tools, and real-time hazard detection, enabling healthcare providers and individuals with mobility challenges to maintain independence, monitor health conditions, and manage daily care routines across residential and clinical settings.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-09-10 07:17:38', '2026-01-28 11:52:22', '2026-01-28 11:52:22'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003229581', 'Trust AI', 'Trust AI', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Bernard Casse', 'Developer of a clinical decision support systems platform intended for diagnostic and treatment planning purposes. The company''s platform integrates voice and text-based interaction, radiographic image analysis, personalized treatment recommendations, insurance verification, and administrative automation, enabling dental practitioners to access specialist-level insights, streamline practice workflows, and improve diagnostic accuracy across routine and complex patient cases in real time.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare;SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-09-10 07:21:29', '2026-01-28 11:52:36', '2026-01-28 11:52:36'),
