  ('zcrm_5797994000003229634', 'Bloomer Tech', 'Bloomer Tech', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Alicia Rodriguez', 'Developer of a fabric engineering technology designed to offer precision cardiovascular care and data services with female physiology. The company''s technology accelerates progress in solving cardiovascular health problems and personalizes healthcare practices by collecting meaningful data, enabling women to know about their electrocardiograms, pulse rates, respiratory rates, and heart rhythms to improve their heart health.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-09-10 07:32:45', '2026-01-28 11:52:45', '2026-01-28 11:52:45'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003229660', 'Empo Health', 'Empo Health', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Anuj Khandelwal', 'Developer of an in-home imaging scale and digital health platform designed to monitor for early signs of diabetic foot conditions and prevent amputations. The company makes full-color imaging scales and does foot monitoring, enabling patients and clinicians to access reliable visual data outside the clinic, and integrates it with the standard of care.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-09-10 07:37:14', '2026-01-28 11:52:55', '2026-01-28 11:52:55'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003229686', 'Matcha Electric', 'Matcha Electric', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Chris Kluesener', 'Matcha Electric is a U.S.-based clean tech startup dedicated to expanding electric vehicle (EV) charging access in shared living environments. Founded in 2021 by Chris Kluesener and Jonathan Sobin, the company aims to make EV ownership feasible for renters by providing turnkey charging solutions for multifamily properties, commercial buildings, and public spaces. Their proprietary platform, MatchaOS, is hardware-agnostic and integrates seamlessly with leading EV charging stations, offering features like smart reservations, dynamic pricing, and energy management.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Competitive Landscape', NULL, '2025-09-10 07:50:10', '2026-01-28 11:53:06', '2026-01-28 11:53:06'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003230018', 'BabyQuip', 'BabyQuip', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Fran Babyquip', 'Founded in May 2016, BabyQuip is the world''s leading baby gear rental service, delivering clean, quality baby gear items—from car seats to strollers and more—to families who don''t want to haul bulky gear while traveling. BabyQuip Cleaning, offers exceptional cleaning services for baby gear for local families and businesses, particularlyfor car seats, strollers, and high chairs. BabyQuip has served over 125,000 families in the US, Canada and beyond
