  ('zcrm_5797994000003230123', 'BigSpring', 'BigSpring', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Bhakti Vithalani', 'BigSpring is an AI-powered revenue acceleration platform, and WEF Tech Pioneer. John Chambers, Stewart Butterfield, and Adam Grant are advisors. Google, Pfizer, Cisco, HSBC, Tata Steel, Liberty Global use BigSpring to equip their ecosystem of teams and partners with the latest product innovation to accelerate business growth. Google Cloud hasincreased partner sales productivity by 2x, Cisco has increased upsell by 216%, Pfizer accelerated time to market by 9x.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-10 06:44:29', '2026-01-05 14:54:13', '2026-01-05 14:54:13'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003230158', 'Diem', 'Diem', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Emma Bates', 'Diem is building a social search engine. It’s a dedicated place for people to search, collect, discover and share information, inspired by the way women have been passing knowledge to each other for centuries. Think of it like the best and biggest group chat you’ve ever been a part of, where all the important, silly, quick, private, and freneticknowledge you share is organized and stored for everyone to benefit from.
Diem incentivizes the community to generate content and harnesses this data to build proprietary search algorithms that will enable people to discover, and visualize, the collective knowledge of entire communities in just a few seconds.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-10 06:49:17', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003230194', 'Quantified', 'Quantified', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Peter Zandan', 'Quantified is an AI-Powered Coaching Platform for Improving Your Conversations. We help customer-facing teams have better conversations, create better customer experiences, and generate more revenue. To learn more, visit www.quantified.ai.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Khalil Thomas', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-10 06:59:49', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
