  ('zcrm_5797994000003233541', 'microBIOMETER', 'Prolific Earth Sciences', 'Angela Zhang', 'Laura Decker', 'The microBIOMETER is an affordable, accessible, and fast solution for measuring soil microbial biomass, empowering users with quality data for informed land management. By enabling agriculturists and soil stewards to monitor microbial communities, it supports better soil structure and plant resilience. This leads to increased carbon sequestrationand improved crop yields. The ultimate goal is to foster sustainable stewardship through science-driven insights.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Angela Zhang', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-09-16 16:36:44', '2025-12-03 13:26:48', '2025-12-03 13:26:48'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003233576', 'Phinite', 'Phinite', 'Angela Zhang', 'Jordan Phasey', 'Phinite is a breakthrough in manure handling. Sludge Management is a problem that threatens Hog Farming in North Carolina. Hog farmers are finding they need to remove sludge from their lagoons, but that land is hard to spread the material is hard to come by. In the last 30 years, poultry litter has been heavily applied to fields around hog farms,and there isn’t enough land left for the lagoon sludge.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Angela Zhang', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-09-16 16:50:56', '2025-12-03 13:26:59', '2025-12-03 13:26:59'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003233611', 'Finch', 'Finch', 'Angela Zhang', 'Lizzie Horvitz', 'Finch is a set of tools that teaches people about sustainability by breaking down complex scientific facts into simple, actionable insights. Launched as a free Chrome browser extension available when shopping on Amazon, Finch surfaces sustainability scores for 84 product categories on a scale of 0-10 based on six environmental footprints. It aimsto decode sustainability and equip people with the knowledge to make better purchasing decisions', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Angela Zhang', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Not Interested', NULL, '2025-09-16 17:06:13', '2025-09-26 11:10:13', '2025-09-26 11:10:13'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003233676', 'FlyFin AI', 'FlyFin AI', 'Alexander Hilton', 'Sachin Rajendra', 'FlyFin is a tax preparation & filing service aimed especially at freelancers, gig workers, independent contractors, small business owners (sole proprietors, LLCs, etc.).', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Alex Hilton', 'Rejected', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-17 03:53:21', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003233711', 'Highstock', 'Highstock', 'Alexander Hilton', 'Camille Van Horne', 'Highstock is a private B2B marketplace that connects brands holding surplus/unsold inventory with vetted wholesale buyers (retailers, distributors, ecommerce, box companies) globally. The company emphasizes brand-safe, discreet selling and handles cross-border logistics, compliance and payments.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'CrunchBase', 'Reached Out', 'Alex Hilton', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, 'Mahek Kasmani', '2025-09-17 04:02:42', '2026-01-26 20:48:10', '2026-01-26 20:48:10'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003233754', 'Pana', 'Pana', 'Alexander Hilton', 'Piero Del Risco', 'Pana is a digital U.S. dollar account + payments app aimed at people who need to send/receive USD “anywhere” (cross-border), with instant, fee-free transfers between Pana users, a virtual debit card, direct deposit, and personal payment links you can share to get paid. It also leans into services useful for newcomers to the U.S., like help getting an ITIN, plus extras like a phone plan and basic health plan options surfaced in-app.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Alex Hilton', 'Rejected', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-17 04:25:28', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003233790', 'GreenMark Biomedical', 'GreenMark Biomedical', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Wendy Bloembergen', 'Operator of a minimally invasive healthcare platform intended to deliver health-based benefits through biobased targeting technologies. The company''s platform uses nanoparticles that illuminate cavities and early-stage lesions using a standard dental curing lamp available in all dental practices and delivers site-specific medical applications, enabling dentists to accurately assess when to treat and make painless, natural repair possible.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Fall 2025', 'PitchBook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-17 06:20:33', '2025-12-02 15:18:29', '2025-12-02 15:18:29'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003233824', 'Polyvascular', 'Polyvascular', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Henri Justino', 'Developer of polymeric transcatheter valves designed to treat congenital heart diseases in children. The company''s valves are easy to manufacture in pediatric and adult sizes, expandable to accommodate children''s growth and reduce the need for repeat open-heart surgeries, enabling healthcare professionals to deliver the valves in a minimally invasive fashion and extend the time between repeat open-heart surgeries.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Fall 2025', 'PitchBook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-17 06:29:20', '2025-12-02 15:18:00', '2025-12-02 15:18:00'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003233850', 'Spanton Dynamics', 'Spanton Dynamics', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Anna Spanton', 'Developer of medical equipment board intended to transfer a patient from the ground to a rigid surface with no additional movement. The company offers a spine board that operates like a conveyor belt and contours underneath a patient, allowing less movement and helping to transport injured patients, enabling health workers to provide patient care efficiently.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Fall 2025', 'PitchBook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-17 06:39:04', '2026-01-27 14:33:30', '2026-01-27 14:33:30'),
