  ('zcrm_5797994000003238081', 'Cosine Additive', 'Cosine Additive', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Jason Miller', 'Manufacturer of 3D printing devices intended to offer advancement in the 3D printing industry. The company''s software is coupled with mass collection of data and machine learning, as well as provides multiple improvements in the performance and output of 3D printers, enabling clients to deliver optimum results with versatility.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', NULL, NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-11 07:29:42', '2025-09-11 07:29:42', NULL),
