  ('zcrm_5797994000003238133', 'Arizona Fuel Operations', 'Arizona Fuel Operations', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Kip Gilleland', 'Operator of a maritime fuel organization intended to offer reduced-sulfur marine diesel fuel. The company''s proprietary thermal cracking process technology offers a commercially viable process to upgrade used motor oil to an IMO 2020-compliant marine diesel fuel, enabling customers to meet stringent requirements and compliance and to create a beneficial impact on the environment.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', NULL, NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-11 08:00:15', '2025-09-11 08:00:15', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003238169', 'Thor Power', 'Thor Power', 'Marina Rezhda', 'David Bonner', 'Manufacturer and developer of technology systems designed to offer electric motor power needs. The company''s systems specialize in electric microelectronics and permanent magnet motors, suitably matched to application-principally, enabling individuals, corporates, and energy industry players with the electric motor power they need to get their jobs done in an effective and hassle-free manner.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-11 17:36:26', '2025-09-11 17:36:26', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003238195', 'Hemut', 'Hemut', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Loki Cheema', 'Operator of logistics software intended to improve freight coordination. The company''s platform specializes in fleet scheduling, load monitoring, document parsing, billing automation, accounting integration, route optimization, and workflow execution, enabling businesses to manage transport operations with reduced manual effort and increased process control.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'In Portfolio', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-11 17:54:09', '2026-01-08 08:38:56', '2026-01-08 08:38:56'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003238226', 'TenTrucks', 'TenTrucks', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Kadir Fuzaylov', 'Developer of a transportation management system designed to simplify the logistics supply chain with AI technology. The company''s platform brings location intelligence, management, and fulfillment visibility of freight transactions and payments in one place, enabling logistics service providers and transportation companies to optimize truck usage, enjoy optimized payment cycles, and plan logistics managers.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-11 17:57:30', '2025-09-11 17:57:30', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003238252', 'EcoPulse', 'EcoPulse', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Joey Burke', 'EcoPulse empowers industries and companies with cutting-edge, AI-driven technologies to tackle the urgent PFAS "forever chemicals" problem.
PFAS ("forever chemicals") is posing a growing challenge to manufacturers and retailers due to the severe health harms these syntheticchemicals can do to people and communities. With increasing global regulations and public attention, companies need smarter tools to analyze and mitigate PFAS risks.
EcoPulse''s PFAS AI™ software is an AI-first software specialized in analyzing and managing PFAS (forever chemicals) risks across material inventory and supply chain in manufacturing — uncovering hidden threats, streamlining compliance and mitigation actions, and saving millions in potential costs.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-11 18:32:53', '2025-09-11 18:32:53', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003238278', 'Industrility', 'Industrility', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Jinesh Varia', 'Developer of an artificial intelligence-powered digital solution designed to help machine manufacturers boost aftermarket parts and service revenue, recurring profitability, and brand value while increasing customer loyalty and internal efficiency. The company''s patented offering uses algorithms and artificial intelligence for the asset''s performance and usage of authorized parts and services predicting the asset score of asset, also helps manufacturers stay connected with their owners/operators/distributors digitally throughout the lifetime of equipment, enabling clients to not only reduce warranty claim costs but also offer new incentive-based offerings.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-11 18:36:29', '2025-09-24 14:29:04', '2025-09-24 14:29:04'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003238343', 'Bopti AI', 'Bopti AI', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Daniel Bascones', 'Connect any machine (e.g. robots, PLC, CNC machine or sensor) by yourself across your production line or fleet.
