  ('zcrm_5797994000003248079', 'Narrativa', 'Narrativa', 'Shakshi Patel', 'David', 'Developer of an artificial intelligence automation platform designed to help life sciences companies streamline the challenging and time-intensive processes associated with regulatory affairs. The company''s platform analyzes, understands, and interprets vast amounts of data and creates insightful narratives in natural language, enabling agencies and businesses to automatically transform data into narrative content.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Shakshi Patel', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-21 09:51:30', '2025-09-21 09:51:30', NULL),
