  ('zcrm_5797994000003248132', 'Hope AI', 'Hope AI', 'Shakshi Patel', 'Will', 'Developer of an AI-powered clinical development platform designed to help clinical teams design more effective trials. The company offers AI-curated clinical evidence, adaptive trial design tools, and synthetic patient data generation, enabling researchers, oncologists, and pharmaceutical companies to improve trial efficiency, accelerate recruitment, and make data-driven decisions with greater accuracy.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Shakshi Patel', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-21 10:19:44', '2025-09-21 10:19:44', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003248159', 'Ageye', 'Ageye', 'Shakshi Patel', 'Nick', 'Developer of a farm management platform designed to transform agriculture by making it more sustainable, space-efficient, and technologically advanced. The company''s platform uses artificial intelligence, computer machine vision, deep learning neural networks, and connected devices to turn visual inputs into growth development insights and autonomous actions, enabling vertical farm operators to become sustainable and scalable through significant reductions in operational costs and improve harvest predictability and profitability.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Shakshi Patel', 'Source', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-09-21 10:51:26', '2025-10-06 09:24:16', '2025-10-06 09:24:16'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003248193', 'Reticular', 'Reticular', 'Shakshi Patel', 'Nithin', 'Developer of AI-powered interpretability tools intended for biological AI systems. The company''s research focuses on developing methods to understand and control the decision-making processes of biological AI models, particularly in protein engineering, enabling researchers and developers to build reliable and predictable AI systems for drug discovery and other bioengineering applications.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Shakshi Patel', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-21 11:04:54', '2025-09-21 11:04:54', NULL),
