  ('zcrm_5797994000003248469', 'Diamond Quanta', 'Diamond Quanta', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Adam Khan', 'Developer of diamond-based electronics designed to advance semiconductor and quantum technologies. The company engages in molecular defect engineering, charge transport optimization, and photonic integration using diamond materials, enabling industries to build compact, energy-efficient devices for power and quantum applications.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitoria Lunardi de Castro', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 18:13:22', '2025-09-28 12:03:11', '2025-09-28 12:03:11'),
