  ('zcrm_5797994000003248526', 'Venaera', 'Venaera', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Jordan Sotudeh', 'Developer of modular, intelligent air-source heat pump systems designed to improve HVAC (Heating, Ventilation, and Air Conditioning) efficiency, grid flexibility, and fault resilience in residential and commercial buildings. The company''s systems use off-the-shelf components in a novel form factor with advanced control software for predictive maintenance, demand response, and modular upgrades, enabling clients to overcome heat pump adoption issues.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitoria Lunardi de Castro', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 18:28:52', '2025-09-28 11:56:55', '2025-09-28 11:56:55'),
